craft.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Contains:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth\" class=\"entity-link\">Azeroth</a>\n            — <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth\" class=\"entity-link\">Azeroth</a> is the primary world of Warcraft.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Contains:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/world-of-warcraft-mmo\" class=\"entity-link\">World of Warcraft</a>\n            — The MMO continues the Warcraft story.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Contains:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/warcraft-iii\" class=\"entity-link\">Warcraft III</a>\n            — <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/warcraft-iii\" class=\"entity-link\">Warcraft III</a> is a cornerstone of the franchise.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/titans\" class=\"entity-link\">Titans</a>\n            — <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/titans\" class=\"entity-link\">Titans</a> is connected to Warcraft through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/sargeras/burning-legion\" class=\"entity-link\">Burning Legion</a>\n            — Warcraft is connected to <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/sargeras/burning-legion\" class=\"entity-link\">Burning Legion</a> through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/horde\" class=\"entity-link\">Horde</a>\n            — Warcraft is connected to <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/horde\" class=\"entity-link\">Horde</a> through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/alliance\" class=\"entity-link\">Alliance</a>\n            — Warcraft is connected to <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/alliance\" 